          "kicker": "LEAGUE WORLD CUP",
          "heading": "Maika Sivo is omitted from Mick Potter's Fiji league World Cup squad",
          "body": "Fiji league head coach Mick Potter has named his 23-man squad for the 2026 Rugby League World Cup, with Leeds Rhinos winger Maika Sivo a major omission. Sivo, the Super League's top try-scorer in 2026, missed the club's run-in with arm and shoulder injuries, though his exclusion is not yet confirmed as injury-related. The squad features Super League players Semi Valemei, Waqa Blake, Taane Milne and new Warrington signing Mitchell Prest. The Bati face Cook Islands, Australia and New Zealand in Pool A."
