          "heading": "RFU set to offer England head coach Steve Borthwick contract extension",
          "body": "The RFU is set to offer England head coach Steve Borthwick a contract extension that will secure his position beyond next year's World Cup. While Borthwick's tenure has faced scrutiny for being full of tactical contradictions, the union is moving to finalise a deal that offers stability. Former England international Ben Kay insisted Borthwick’s side can reach the standard required to win the tournament, provided the head coach addresses key areas including midfield selection and club relationships ahead of the upcoming autumn campaign."
