          "kicker": "BY THE NUMBERS",
          "heading": "France amass over 400 points across their last 11 test matches",
          "body": "France have scored 426 points and conceded 291 across their last 11 internationals. This sequence yields an average of 38.7 points scored and 26.5 points conceded per match. The largest margin of victory in this 11-match window was a 54-12 away win against Wales in February 2026 during the Six Nations. Currently, France sit third of 12 teams in the Nations Championship table with two victories from their three matches."
