          "heading": "Scotland's former players find no resolution to their massive legal bill",
          "body": "There has been no further progress reported today regarding the £2.8 million legal bill hanging over the former Scotland players involved in rugby’s landmark brain injury lawsuit. Since the funding crisis was first detailed last week, no news has emerged of any financial rescue package or settlement talks. The claimants remain in limbo as they seek the resources required to keep their litigation active against the game's governing bodies."
