          "kicker": "World Cup bid",
          "heading": "Argentina launches ambitious joint bid to host 2035 Rugby World Cup",
          "body": "Argentina has officially launched a historic four-nation bid alongside Uruguay, Chile and Brazil to host the men's 2035 Rugby World Cup. The Argentine Rugby Union is leading the proposal, which would bring the tournament to South America for the first time. Technical details have been submitted to World Rugby, listing eight Argentine venues including Buenos Aires' Monumental and José Amalfitani stadiums, alongside Rio de Janeiro’s iconic Maracanã. World Rugby will select the preferred host in May 2027."
        },
