          "heading": "Allan Alaalatoa hails 'freak' Mark Nawaqanitawase as winger prepares for rugby return",
          "body": "Australia prop Allan Alaalatoa believes the impending return of Mark Nawaqanitawase \"automatically lifts the group\" ahead of next year's home World Cup. The 26-year-old winger concluded a decorated two-year rugby league stint on Sunday, winning the NRL grand final with the Sydney Roosters. While Nawaqanitawase joins Japan's Saitama Wild Knights in December, Alaalatoa expects his presence to eventually drive internal competition. The Wallabies are currently preparing for a Bledisloe Cup opener against an All Blacks side led by former coach Dave Rennie."
        },
